---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site.mjs';
---
<Base title="Our story" description="The story behind Tantu Kala — handmade crochet, one knot at a time.">
  <div class="wrap py-10 max-w-2xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl">Our story</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-saffron font-semibold">Tantu Kala — "the art of thread"</p>

    <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Tantu Kala is a small handmade-crochet studio. It started the way most good things
        do — quietly, with a ball of cotton yarn, a hook, and a few unhurried evenings. What
        began as a hobby turned into a habit, and then into something we couldn't not share:
        pieces made slowly, by hand, meant to be kept.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every rakhi is crocheted one knot at a time, in small batches. That means no two are
        exactly alike — a slightly fuller petal here, a knot that sits a little differently
        there. Those aren't flaws; they're the fingerprint of something made by a person, for
        a person.
      </p>
      <p>
        We work in soft cotton yarn and fuss over the little things — colour, finish, the way
        it sits on the wrist. When a design says "made to order," it's being crocheted
        especially for you, so it takes a few days. We think it's worth the wait.
      </p>
      <p>
        This Raksha Bandhan we're making a limited number of rakhis. Thank you for choosing
        something handmade — it genuinely means a lot to a small studio like ours.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 card p-6 bg-sand">
      <p class="font-display text-xl text-maroon">Made by hand · Made in India</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/70">
        Have a custom request or a bulk order? Message us on
        <a href={`https://wa.me/${SITE.whatsapp}`} class="text-henna font-semibold underline">WhatsApp</a>
        or <a href={SITE.instagram} class="text-henna font-semibold underline">Instagram</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/" class="btn-primary mt-8">Shop this season's rakhis</a>
  </div>
</Base>
